This package has mixed record-level licenses. No single license applies to the entire repository.

For each active record, follow its publication_rights and the matching source entry in sources.json. See LICENSES.md, LICENSE_STATUS.md, and ATTRIBUTION.md for the release-wide summary.

The exact v1.2.0 package is retained under history/v1.2.0/. All 833 historical records are also included in the unified v2.0.0 corpus. The 506 legacy CAICT QA records retain their prior CC BY 4.0 record license; the dataset owner confirmed authorization to republish them. This does not assert a CC BY 4.0 license for the underlying source reports, which are not included.
